      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CORONATION DAY (3) has been in the placings at her last two runs, finishing second most recently over 1000m at Morven. Likely to push forward and race on the pace. Will give backers a great sight. BEL SONG (2) was a placegetter on dirt over 1200m at Aramac two back but missed the frame on turf over 1000m at Emerald last time. Will be harder to beat back to the dirt here. FYANSFORD FLYER (4) has hit the frame at her past three outings and looks to be working up to a maiden victory. In the mix. GRAPHIEN (5) was out of the money two runs back then missed the frame last start over 1000m at Emerald, beaten 2.75 lengths into sixth. This doesn't look as hard so she is sure to be prominent.",
